

Suggested media types to support :

1) Essentials 

    Text / markup
    =============
    text/html
    text/plain
    text/css

    JavaScript
    ==========
    application/javascript

    Images
    ======
    image/png
    image/jpeg
    image/gif
    image/x-icon


With just these, you can serve:
    
    1) HTML pages
    2) CSS styling
    3) JS scripts
    4) basic images + favicon

2. Strongly Recommended (modern web)

    Modern images
    =============
    image/svg+xml
    image/webp

    JSON (APIs, AJAX)
    application/json

    Fonts
    =====
    font/woff
    font/woff2

    Forms / uploads
    ===============
    application/x-www-form-urlencoded
    multipart/form-data

3. Nice-to-Have (depending on scope)
    
    XML
    ===
    application/xml
    text/xml
    
    PDFs / downloads
    ================
    application/pdf
    application/octet-stream

    Video / audio (basic support)
    =============================
    video/mp4
    audio/mpeg